      "updated": 1790179539400,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The first testing level, especiall in UI work is MANUAL testing.\nVibe check. Does it *look* correct?\n    - checking different modes is always a big part of this.\n\nSome of those tests will become automated.\n",
